{
"#desc"
:
{
"zh"
:
"X内置模板字符串替换封装"
,
"en"
:
"X built-in template string replace"
}
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"hello_tmp=\"${___X_CMD_TX} world\"; x tmpl \"$hello_tmp\" \"hello\""
,
"zh"
:
"将包含的模板字符串 'hello_tmp' 替换为 hello 然后打印"
,
"en"
:
"replace 'hello_tmp' include template string to hello then print"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x tmpl \"${___X_CMD_T}:abc:, ${___X_CMD_T}:cde:\" :cde:=world :abc:=hello"
,
"zh"
:
"将模板字符串替换为 :abc: 和 :cde: 字符串变量然后打印"
,
"en"
:
"replace template string to :abc: and :cde: string variable then print"
}
]
}

